From: jay.cornwall at amd.com (Jay Cornwall)
Date: Mon, 6 Jul 2026 17:00:43 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] drm/amdkfd: Fix named barrier restore in gfx12.1 trap handler
Message-ID: <20260706220043.612554-1-jay.cornwall@amd.com>

Barrier state layout has non-zero fields above the signal count.
Mask these off to restore the correct signal count.

Signed-off-by: Jay Cornwall <jay.cornwall at amd.com>
Cc: Lancelot Six <lancelot.six at amd.com>
Cc: Vladimir Indic <vladimir.indic at amd.com>
Cc: Tishko Araz <tishko.araz at amd.com>
Cc: Max Erenberg <max.erenberg at amd.com>
---
 .../gpu/drm/amd/amdkfd/cwsr_trap_handler.h | 52 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++--------------------------
 .../amd/amdkfd/cwsr_trap_handler_gfx12.asm | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 27 insertions(+), 27 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/amdkfd/cwsr_trap_handler.h b/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/amdkfd/cwsr_trap_handler.h
index 8cf3527dc156..d976812c5c2e 100644
